Now that we have this forum established, there will be an announcement each time a new stable version is placed on github and/or on CRAN.

You can access these with

Installing from CRAN

install.packages("dartR")
library(dartR)

Installing from GitHub

install.packages("devtools")

library(devtools)

install_github("green-striped-gecko/dartR")

library(dartR)
Installing the developmental version (always up to date)

install.packages("devtools")

library(devtools)

install_github("green-striped-gecko/dartR", ref="dev")

library(dartR)

Hope this helps.

