Hi Tess,

If you download the latest version 1.1.6., there is now a gl.amova function, which basically uses hierfstat amova.

The function is a very simply wrapper and does only use pop as the testing factor. If you look at it you should be able to use if for your purpose, though not sure what kind of analysis you are after.

Cheers, Bernd

